<title>USA: Matsushita to license Iomega drives.</title>
<headline>Matsushita to license Iomega drives.</headline>
<dateline>ROY, Utah 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iomega Corp said Tuesday it agreed to license Matsushita Communication Industrial Co Ltd Co to manufacture and sell Zip drives compatible with Iomega's award winning design.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Matsushita is granted a nonexclusive worldwide license to produce Zip drives and sell them under Matsushita's brand names as well as to original equipment makers, Iomega said. Matsushita plans to start production in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>Matsushita Communication is a partially owned subsidiary of Matsushita Electric Industrial Co Ltd.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
